# Seaforged GitHub Organization Profile

## Purpose

This repository is the GitHub organization profile for Seaforged. The `profile/README.md` renders as the landing page at github.com/Seaforged.

## Product Roster

| Product | Type | Status | Repo |
|---------|------|--------|------|
| BS Tuner | Desktop PID tuning app | Patent Pending | bs-tuner |
| D-TECT-R | Counter-drone RF detection/ML classification | Enterprise | (private) |
| TIDENET | Mesh networking for field operations | In Development | (TBD) |
| TRIDENT | ESP32 FPV video repeater | In Development | trident |
| SENTRY-RF | Passive RF detection + GNSS monitoring | Open Source | sentry-rf |
| JUH-MAK-IN JAMMER | Drone signal test suite | Open Source | juh-mak-in-jammer |

## Company Identity

- Veteran-owned (U.S. Navy)
- NDAA-compliant defense/government solutions
- FAA Part 107 certified
- Made in USA

## Required Skills & Workflow

- **seaforged-brand** — Use for ALL visual updates. Enforces brand colors, typography, and logo placement.
- **copywriting** — Use when updating product descriptions or marketing copy.
- **seo** suite — Use when optimizing the profile for discoverability.
- **document-skills** — Use for generating branded PDFs or presentations from this content.

## Editing Rules

- Always use the seaforged-brand skill when touching profile/README.md
- Product descriptions must be concise (1-2 sentences each)
- Keep the logo and badges at the top
- Update product status when repos change
